  "description": "Provide Microsoft Azure extensions to the Microsoft Bot Builder.  In particular this includes:\n      * TableLogger -- Activity logger for table storage which allows recording and retrieving conversation activities.\n      * ReplayTranscript -- Replay activity history on any channel.\n      * AzureModule -- Module for setting up components for bot builder based on Azure dependencies\n      * TableBotDataStore -- IBotDataStore implementation based on Azure table storage.",
